        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The undead never stop coming… but neither do you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZK1L4 is a <strong>Left 4 Dead–style roguelike survival shooter</strong> where every run tells a different story. Fight through five handcrafted apocalypse scenarios, unlock devastating skills, and push forward toward a final escape… or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, brutal, and endlessly replayable: ZK1L4 blends <strong>cinematic zombie survival</strong> with <strong>roguelike progression and chaos</strong>. Think <i>Left 4 Dead meets a bullet-heaven roguelite.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique survivors</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>60+ Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>60+ active and passive skills</strong> to create broken, beautiful chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical hit builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifesteal monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive on-hit effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-defining synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Your build defines how you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Players Couch Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend, you’ll need them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight side by side in <strong>local 2-player co-op</strong>, combining builds, saving each other from the swarm, and turning desperate runs into heroic escapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a chapter in the apocalypse:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clear narrative goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just surviving! you’re <strong>moving through a collapsing world</strong> toward the truth behind the outbreak.<strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>30 lore collectibles</strong> scattered across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one reveals what happened before and during the zombie apocalypse: survivors, experiments, betrayals, and the price of failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swarm is endless… but not all zombies are equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying enemy types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneaky</strong> – Silent, deadly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatty</strong> – Slow, but explosive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast</strong> – Relentless hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanky</strong> – Brutal damage sponges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goliath</strong> – A walking apocalypse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now… a new threat:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Golden Sir</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare elite enemy that drops <strong>powerful rewards</strong> if you can take it down.<br>High risk. High reward. Total chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras/80e90f2af243c13f42c18bb175e03abd.avif?t=1774125382\" width=720 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The undead never stop coming… but neither do you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZK1L4 is a <strong>Left 4 Dead–style roguelike survival shooter</strong> where every run tells a different story. Fight through five handcrafted apocalypse scenarios, unlock devastating skills, and push forward toward a final escape… or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, brutal, and endlessly replayable: ZK1L4 blends <strong>cinematic zombie survival</strong> with <strong>roguelike progression and chaos</strong>. Think <i>Left 4 Dead meets a bullet-heaven roguelite.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique survivors</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>60+ Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>60+ active and passive skills</strong> to create broken, beautiful chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical hit builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifesteal monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive on-hit effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-defining synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Your build defines how you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Players Couch Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend, you’ll need them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight side by side in <strong>local 2-player co-op</strong>, combining builds, saving each other from the swarm, and turning desperate runs into heroic escapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a chapter in the apocalypse:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clear narrative goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just surviving! you’re <strong>moving through a collapsing world</strong> toward the truth behind the outbreak.<strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>30 lore collectibles</strong> scattered across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one reveals what happened before and during the zombie apocalypse: survivors, experiments, betrayals, and the price of failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swarm is endless… but not all zombies are equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying enemy types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneaky</strong> – Silent, deadly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatty</strong> – Slow, but explosive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast</strong> – Relentless hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanky</strong> – Brutal damage sponges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goliath</strong> – A walking apocalypse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now… a new threat:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Golden Sir</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare elite enemy that drops <strong>powerful rewards</strong> if you can take it down.<br>High risk. High reward. Total chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras/80e90f2af243c13f42c18bb175e03abd.avif?t=1774125382\" width=720 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Survive relentless hordes in ZK1L4, a fast-paced bullet heaven! Choose unique characters, unleash powerful weapons, and master deadly skills. Play solo or team up in couch co-op to take on the chaos. Will you escape the swarm or become one with it?",
